      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在竞赛界中，没有人不晓得她的存在。\n她可是曾经活跃于后冠路线，\n留下华丽战绩的传说级赛马娘──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd84115ae93c9b5bf9e28dc816ea9b2fbbcaae5e560ee8b4905e81c623478ed4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
