    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974bf6518119e06c642bb32c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她自现役选手引退后，\n在世界各国促进赛马娘界的发展。\n我记得她已经获颁好几个世界级奖项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6768786cf487f5a1bfa499f536ca610e5a39340e237ec3c8581ac765ff210ac2",
